<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img class="phero-img" src="/assets/img/photos/hartford-office-tower.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hartford-office-tower-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hartford-office-tower.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="1800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="kicker kicker-light">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services in Connecticut</h1><p class="phero-lede">From a single estimate review to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every Connecticut Insurance Appraiser service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="/contact-ct-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="icards" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/appraisal-clause-appraiser/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 01</span><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>We act as the appraiser you name after you or your carrier demands appraisal under the policy.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/homeowners-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/victorian-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/victorian-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/victorian-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 02</span><h2>Homeowners Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Independent valuation for single-family, multifamily and condo-unit claims when the carrier’s estimate falls short.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/commercial-condo-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hartford-office-tower.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hartford-office-tower-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hartford-office-tower.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="1800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 03</span><h2>Commercial, Condo &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for offices, retail, industrial buildings, condo associations and mixed-use properties with large disputes.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/roof-and-hail-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="526" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 04</span><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Roof-plane measurements, hail and wind documentation, and pricing for asphalt, slate, wood and metal roofs.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/wind-and-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-home-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-home-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-home-damage.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 05</span><h2>Wind &amp; Tornado Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Valuation of roof, siding and structural damage from thunderstorms, microbursts, nor’easters and tornadoes.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/hurricane-and-tropical-storm-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/stormy-beach.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/stormy-beach-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/stormy-beach.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 06</span><h2>Hurricane &amp; Tropical Storm Appraisal</h2><p>Shoreline and inland claims from hurricanes and tropical storms, including wind versus water questions.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/rain-window.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/rain-window-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/rain-window.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 07</span><h2>Water &amp; Frozen Pipe Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Burst pipes, appliance leaks and storm water entry, with drying, demolition and rebuild scope fully valued.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/fire-and-smoke-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 08</span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Structure, smoke, soot and contents valuation after kitchen fires, chimney fires and total losses.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/fallen-tree-damage-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-trees-down.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-trees-down-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hurricane-trees-down.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="720" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 09</span><h2>Fallen Tree Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Connecticut’s signature peril: oaks and maples through roofs, decks and garages after nor’easters and tropical storms.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/ice-dam-and-winter-storm-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/foursquare-snow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/foursquare-snow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/foursquare-snow.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="864" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 10</span><h2>Ice Dam &amp; Winter Storm Appraisal</h2><p>Ice dam leaks, snow-load damage and roof collapses from Connecticut’s heavy winters and blizzards.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/insurance-estimate-review/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 11</span><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the carrier’s estimate so you know exactly what is missing before you dispute anything.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/ct-appraisal-services/umpire-services/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/team-laptops.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/team-laptops-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/team-laptops.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Service 12</span><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire services for appraisal panels that need an experienced, impartial third member.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/ct-appraisal-services/insurance-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<svg class="ic chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and association claims?<svg class="ic chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes: offices, retail, mills, churches, condo associations and HOAs, as well as one- to four-family homes.</p></div></details><details><summary>Which Connecticut perils do you see most?<svg class="ic chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Fallen trees, ice dams, wind and hurricane damage, frozen pipes and fire, with hail in inland areas.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-strip-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the carrier’s number is right?</h2><p>Send the estimate and a few photos. We’ll tell you what we see, free.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="/contact-ct-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
